---
permalink: /search-titles.json
layout: null
---
{%- comment -%}
Title-only index for typo-tolerant search (MiniSearch, client side).

Pagefind handles full-text but has weak typo tolerance — "ketlebell" ranks
garbage. This tiny index (~9KB gzipped for ~350 posts) is fuzzy-matched in the
browser to rescue misspelled *titles*, and merged into the Pagefind results.

Kept deliberately small: title + url only. Descriptions are looked up from
back-links.json, which the client already loads for recent/random posts.

Exclusions mirror _includes/pagefind-attrs.html. The family journal (_ig66) is
a separate collection and is not concatenated below, but the fj/tag guards stay
as belt-and-suspenders.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign entries = site.posts | concat: site.d | concat: site.td -%}
[
{%- assign sep = "" -%}
{%- for p in entries -%}
  {%- if p.title == nil or p.title == empty -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- if p.fj -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- if p.tags contains 'family-journal' -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- if p.search_exclude -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- if site.search.exclude_permalinks contains p.permalink -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- if site.search.exclude_permalinks contains p.url -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
  {{ sep }}{"t":{{ p.title | jsonify }},"u":{{ p.url | jsonify }}}
  {%- assign sep = "," -%}
{%- endfor -%}
]
